meta {
  name: 52-org-collections
  seq: 52
}

docs {
  Collections in the admin console: list with access, create, read, change,
  who has access, bulk access, delete. Needs `50-org-admin-setup`.

  `CollectionAccessDetailsResponse` is `CollectionResponse` (Id, OrganizationId,
  Name, ExternalId, Type) plus ReadOnly, HidePasswords, Manage, Assigned,
  Groups, Users, Unmanaged.
}
